COMMENT ON COLUMN "lmf"."CONCERN"."CONTAMINANTS_SALTS" IS 'If a conservation problem (see field name) is identified in the general area of the sample point, this will be marked "Y"; if, not, then "N". See protocol (Ch. 17) for definitions of conservation problems.';
