COMMENT ON COLUMN "lmf"."PRACTICE"."P575" IS 'Trails and Walkways (Present): A trail is a constructed path with a vegetated or earthen surface. A walkway is a constructed path with an artificial surface. A trail/walkway is used to facilitate the movement of animals, people, or off-road vehicles. If this conservation practice has been applied in the plot or within the general area of the plot, this will be marked "Y"; if not, "N".';
